70 < 63a + 7b < 80 \Rightarrow \frac{70 - 63a}{7} < b < \frac{80 - 63a}{7}
$$
So now we can solve for integer values $ (a, b) $ that fit both inequalities.

Let’s try small integer values of $ a $ and find values of $ b $ that fit both conditions.

---

